Distance<http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=BPFK+Section%3A+Distance>now
meets the formatting standards of BPFK Community Work.

Again, I moved the entries in the now-deleted "Formal Definitions" section
to the "Proposed Tag" section of the individual cmavo.

I added the other cmavo of the same selma'o and the gismu of the "Proposed
Tag" to the "See Also" section for each cmavo.
(For example, {ze'a} has the Proposed Tag {fi'o krafamtei}, and in See Also
has {ze'e}, {ze'i}, {ze'u}, {krasi}, {fanmo}, and {temci}.)

I copied the relevant bits in the old "Notes" section to those cmavo the
note referenced.

I moved everything in the now-deleted "Impact" section to the "General
Section Issues" section.

The "Proposed Keywords" and "Issues" sections for all cmavo have no entry.

